{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "8fd95bc30fb7f55bfa08a666f68f94561d0cd18f8540e9fa66c688d2f45e12ff", "ja": "青い海、眩しい太陽、キラっと光る釣り竿の先……\nそして、あの子の笑顔……ふふっ♪", "zh": "蔚蓝的大海，耀眼的阳光，钓竿尖端闪闪发光……\n还有，那孩子的笑容……呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "ecf39ba5d122e9441d041e4b33688f266297d4b3b89eee10f3f028aa24d58f1d", "ja": "お疲れ様です、青羽さん。\nなんだか嬉しそうですね。何かあったんですか？", "zh": "辛苦了，青羽小姐。\n你好像很开心呢。发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "e3659c457abedf878d21a2a11647719db72031a1e3a45fe15d62f9a2e275758b", "ja": "……えへへっ♪", "zh": "……诶嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "863887f92340f374bd9ae7f74f5a95bec1fc603dafbb360c6a58121f668b002e", "ja": "あの……青羽さん？", "zh": "那个……青羽小姐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "ddfd258c129481f20c0a7727a5c75356e5c6af2278c4364a0c22cccd582cbc0b", "ja": "ひゃあ！？　{$P$}さん！\nお、おおお、お疲れさまです！", "zh": "呀！？{$P$}先生！\n您、您您您辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_intro_1005_p", "source_sha256": "de69ca03e0096e483fd4de0745d97b28f9816518fdcd042afa91d0b26ae4161d", "ja": "すみません。\n驚かせちゃったみたいですね。", "zh": "对不起。好像吓到您了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "1f0b3ccde53dfec1da3fd51af207cdd486374bea840b4f72fb93358f30771c67", "ja": "いえ、こちらこそすみません。\nちょっと学生時代の思い出に浸ってて……。", "zh": "不，我这边才不好意思呢。\n刚才沉浸在学生时代的回忆里了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "cb04497d7464d92633384ff24e7d3775cd205f86caa2c3ecc4a09df67af10bcb", "ja": "そうだったんですか。\n学生時代の思い出、いいですね。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。\n学生时代的回忆，真不错呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "470102381f3ac2b964876673b3f5394f5b6b287f6598e490d54ed0392556e97e", "ja": "はい。あの頃は青春だったなぁって……あっ！\nそういえば、社長さんがお呼びでしたよ！", "zh": "是啊。那段时光真是青春啊……啊！\n对了，社长叫您过去呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_intro_1009_p", "source_sha256": "7a8873a08856cdd4420fbf99cfdec4cb5375b8ba55e8f057c61c4440116a6894", "ja": "本当ですか？　ありがとうございます！\n早速、事務所に行ってきますね。", "zh": "真的吗？谢谢您！\n我这就去办公室。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_intro_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "f6ddd7474a09aa0ac93bea192dc50ce4045afbebac1d0aa43c302e967cb6ca7a", "ja": "はーい！　行ってらっしゃーい♪", "zh": "好——！路上小心哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_intro_1011_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_intro_1012_p", "source_sha256": "edbb15a5bf3099066431b8adde67506533a59363675013432196077781f72d41", "ja": "社長、音無さん、お疲れ様です。……あれ？\nなんだかいい香りがしますね。", "zh": "社长、音无女士，辛苦了。……咦？\n这里好像有股不错的香味呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_intro_1013_101kot", "source_sha256": "b174fdba6fd8c7c504fa2b70caf3126dc40a0cd61b929bc0b9eff940909d83f5", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！　お疲れさまです。\n事務所にルームフレグランスを置いてみたんですよ。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！辛苦了。\n我试着在事务所放了室内香氛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_intro_1014_president", "source_sha256": "f173a7b52ea3ef0d9b3d7542d9bc56a3f3df5039852fcb1a5d38db5b25d221ba", "ja": "なかなか爽やかな香りで、私も気に入っているよ。\n晴れ渡る空のように、クリアな香りだ！", "zh": "香气相当清爽，我也很喜欢。\n是如同万里晴空般清新的香气！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_intro_1015_p", "source_sha256": "51e54229375dd610c522ecec5837356423160c5e0d94c549da7ae2c290c9b42a", "ja": "たしかに爽快感のある香りですね！\nそれでいて、少し甘酸っぱいような……。", "zh": "确实是种让人感觉清爽的香味呢！\n同时又有一点酸酸甜甜的感觉……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_intro_1016_101kot", "source_sha256": "5db153705145d9827b933e558ce4c0d00d2fcdcdc9b27a1d5617d5dcf8f37157", "ja": "うふふ。このフレグランス、『青春』っていう\n名前なんですよ。だからちょっと甘酸っぱいのかも？", "zh": "呵呵。这款香氛的名字叫\n“青春”哦。所以可能才会带点酸甜吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_intro_1017_p", "source_sha256": "10ffc307b6aa619e4ab8ea5fa01a4895f00ed5fb3c6a195e955524be341d2b3b", "ja": "なるほど、青春ですか。\nなんだか今日は、その言葉をよく聞く気が……。", "zh": "原来是“青春”啊。总觉得今天好像经常听到这个词……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "bcad3c1bc0d84297ee76b858ec65da5b2e00d590a7d8df366eea3902b9572450", "ja": "おっと、そうだった。青春といえば、\n君に任せたい仕事があるのだよ！", "zh": "哦，对了，说到青春，\n有件工作想交给你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_intro_1019_p", "source_sha256": "43d3c6fba2a390611692f44454ed61c5a94943c96d930f78af693e4101b1ce86", "ja": "はい、なんでしょう？", "zh": "可以啊，什么事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_intro_1020_president", "source_sha256": "d31259d304d3e0da495f785a05bb15230e355f7f2090988bbfb554d9e5e6d7d8", "ja": "実は、島原エレナ君と宮尾美也君のユニット、\nCleaskyのリバイバル公演が決定してね！", "zh": "其实，岛原艾琳娜和宫尾美也的组合——\nCleasky已经确定要举办复活演出了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_intro_1021_p", "source_sha256": "1a4df4a45c95cfcfa1cca247be04f0da257e0557b9143fd947c32da6aca1dfdd", "ja": "おおっ、本当ですか？　たしかにCleaskyは\n青春がテーマのユニットですからね。", "zh": "哦哦，真的吗？确实，Cleasky是以青春为主题的组合呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_intro_1022_president", "source_sha256": "426ae5cd6117dc8adc345d8101be4d22947b3b4481302b547f1d2456c7bd424a", "ja": "うむ！　これも、ファンの応援あってこそ！\nそこで、その公演に先駆けて……", "zh": "嗯！这也是多亏了粉丝们的支持！\n所以，在那场公演之前……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_intro_1023_president", "source_sha256": "7cdffb5682dd40359266f75cb22f7bb246843675667330bd2464198a4ba47426", "ja": "ファンミーティングを開催することが決まった！\n場所は、青空の下の野外ステージだ。", "zh": "粉丝见面会的举办事宜已经确定！\n地点是蓝天下的户外舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_intro_1024_p", "source_sha256": "bd64224bffbe261c215fb8a554a84917c927174fc713c6fdd3bfbec0ac630681", "ja": "青空の下の野外ステージ……。\nユニットのイメージにもピッタリですね！", "zh": "蓝天下的户外舞台……\n和组合的形象太相称了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_intro_1025_president", "source_sha256": "39f81f8e6e64ff681a3974e8cb3e34040fddc7f935ee11f71d3f76c6a0f4dcf6", "ja": "そうだろう！　で、君にはその素晴らしいステージで\n行う、ファンミーティングの内容を考えてもらいたい。", "zh": "没错！那么，我想请你考虑一下在那个精彩舞台上举办的粉丝见面会内容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_intro_1026_p", "source_sha256": "159ae11dc10f621f62cb51265b695f712bfcf544d6b9d8a512f3b2a4f55120e9", "ja": "わかりました！　そうですね。\nせっかくだし、青春にまつわる企画とか……あっ。", "zh": "明白了！嗯……难得有这个机会，要不要策划一些和青春有关的企划……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_intro_1027_101kot", "source_sha256": "7f4d77db92944e60fb0b1f544a4f9ff7849f8eeb262d74bbd0b7611d0dbe2387", "ja": "さすが{$P$}さん。\n早速、何か思いつかれたみたいですね！", "zh": "不愧是{$P$}先生。\n您似乎马上就想到什么了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_intro_1028_p", "source_sha256": "678bc44317585c33b89f50c7c011d678d9802edd7b823d952b7556fafc78549d", "ja": "はい。今まさに青春を送っている人達を対象にした、\nお悩み相談というのはどうでしょう？", "zh": "是的。不如面向正值青春的人们，做一个烦恼咨询节目，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_intro_1029_president", "source_sha256": "97816025f779777cb9879b8303d4dfd88b6c64e0f2c4e383229cb48a98affe06", "ja": "ほう！　お悩み相談か。青春には悩みがつきもの\nだからね。その方向でいこうじゃないか！", "zh": "哦！是烦恼咨询啊。青春总是少不了烦恼，\n那就朝这个方向努力吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_intro_1030_101kot", "source_sha256": "2c4b842aa9d267eead42bd9b10e47fb28b2332a0988d6ddacaa2a5ae08d2805c", "ja": "Cleaskyのふたりは、出演したドラマの中でも、\n悩んで傷ついて、成長していましたよね。", "zh": "Cleasky的两个人，在出演的电视剧里也是\n历经烦恼与伤痛，逐渐成长起来的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_intro_1031_p", "source_sha256": "d479dcaef9c9eeede7ffbe41f87064b3c1d3d8c4ac0e6938e0678f283a5853ec", "ja": "はい。あのドラマを経たふたりなら、ファンの人達の\nお悩みにも、答えられるんじゃないかと！", "zh": "是的。经历过那部电视剧的她们，说不定也能帮粉丝们解答烦恼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_intro_1032_101kot", "source_sha256": "f573d14aa32986b7c6b71ff7aaf0aef58f2baf14266043f29dac81e724078db7", "ja": "そうですね。私もふたりに相談してみようかしら？\n2X歳になっても、悩みは尽きないもの……。", "zh": "是啊。我也去找她们商量一下好了？即使到了2X岁，烦恼也还是没完没了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_intro_1033_p", "source_sha256": "dc1e73c667d532b65c5d8c13c48eb60204d06b1e536289bc36ded20f4ebe3dea", "ja": "あ、すみません。今回はファンの人達が対象なので、\n音無さんはまた別の機会に、ということで……。", "zh": "啊，不好意思。这次的对象是粉丝们，\n所以音无小姐还是等下次有机会吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_intro_1034_101kot", "source_sha256": "d506ac34288358bc82e62871017d3fcb6b1b9ba0f3691c59a8766e95cbafdd8a", "ja": "ぴ、ピヨ～……。", "zh": "啾、啾——……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_intro_1035_president", "source_sha256": "ddca1edc5e7fbcf8e0d6b666f3437a5ea5ea46120a9e5814e21c66aaae85f08d", "ja": "はっはっは。では君、任せたよ！", "zh": "哈哈哈。那么就交给你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_intro_1036_president", "source_sha256": "78a7e403e194ab6f40e815e670babc6ab4cfbc714a59c20b698f7df2db68e710", "ja": "青春時代にタイムトリップしたような、\nそんな時間を味わえることを期待しているよ！", "zh": "期待能让你体验到仿佛穿越回青春时代的那段时光！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
